@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Two-Phase Readiness: Same Mechanism, Different Events

participant "Gateway\n(GatewayWorker)" as GW
participant "Engine\n(EngineWorker)" as ENG
participant "Provider\nSimulators" as PROV
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ

== Phase 1: System Readiness ==

note over GW, ENG
  Both workers SetupRabbitMq(), then each publish ServiceReadyEvent
end note

GW -> MQ: ServiceReadyEvent("Gateway")
ENG -> MQ: ServiceReadyEvent("Engine")

note over ENG
  Engine's ServiceReadyHandler collects events in static HashSet. Required: {"Gateway", "Engine"}
end note

MQ -> ENG: Deliver both events
ENG -> MQ: Publish SystemReadyEvent (all required services ready)

MQ -> GW: SystemReadyEvent
MQ -> ENG: SystemReadyEvent

GW -> GW: MarkSystemReady()
ENG -> ENG: MarkSystemReady()

note over GW, ENG
  Phase 1 complete. WaitForSystemReadyAsync() unblocked.
end note

== Phase 2: Provider Readiness ==

note over GW, ENG
  Same TaskCompletionSource mechanism — different event triggers unblock
end note

GW -> GW: (unblocked) PublishStartProviders() \n → StartAllProvidersCommand

GW -> GW: Orchestrate Docker containers
GW -> MQ: RequestAllProviderStartedCommand\n(broadcast ping — via AsyncAwaiter)

MQ -> PROV: Deliver to all provider instances
PROV -> MQ: ProviderStartedEvent (each)
MQ -> GW: Collect responses (AsyncAwaiter AwaitMultipleAsync)

GW -> GW: CompletionCondition: all expected\nprovider IDs responded
GW -> MQ: Publish AllProvidersStartedEvent

MQ -> GW: AllProvidersStartedEvent
MQ -> ENG: AllProvidersStartedEvent

GW -> GW: MarkProvidersReady()
ENG -> ENG: MarkProvidersReady()

note over GW, ENG
  Phase 2 complete. WaitForProvidersReadyAsync() unblocked.
end note

== HTTP Request Processing ==

GW -> GW: Middleware:IsSystemReady & IsProvidersReady\n → allow request through

@enduml